<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Subscription Renewed successfully</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .email-wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .email-header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669); padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff; }
        .email-header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; }
        .email-body { padding: 40px 30px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .email-body h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0; }
        .invoice-card { background-color: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .btn-cta { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #10b981; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; margin: 20px 0; }
        .email-footer { background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-header">
            <h1>Payment Processed</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="email-body">
            <h2>Hello, {{ manager.firstName }}</h2>
            <p>Your subscription payment for CenterTime has been processed successfully. Your account is fully active and all premium features remain enabled.</p>
            
            <div class="invoice-card">
                <strong>Renewal Details:</strong><br>
                <ul>
                    <li>Amount Charged: <strong>${{ amount }}</strong></li>
                    <li>Date: <strong>{{ "now"|date('M d, Y') }}</strong></li>
                    <li>Next Renewal Date: <strong>{{ renewalDate }}</strong></li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="https://centertime.us/manager/billing" class="btn-cta">Manage Billing & Invoices</a>
            </div>

            <p>If you have any questions or require custom invoicing details, please don't hesitate to write to us.</p>
            <p>Best regards,<br>The CenterTime Team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="email-footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 CenterTime. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
